---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Watch
description: "Videos from Tamica M. Roberson on YouTube, Instagram, TikTok and Facebook, with style, travel in Europe, military spouse life and the story behind SEASONS."
permalink: /watch/
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import logo, polaroids, video, subscribe with context %}
{#- Tamica's introduction lives on the Home page; Watch shows the newest videos as they come. #}
{% set newest = youtube.latest[0] %}
{% set more = youtube.latest.slice(1) %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Watch</p>
    <h1>Short films from Europe and beyond</h1>
    <p class="lede">New videos every week: the places behind the books, outfits straight from the pages, and honest talk about healing, marriage and military life.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if newest %}
<section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="newest">
  <div class="wrap watch-intro">
    {{ video(newest, "video--feature") }}
    <div class="watch-intro__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Newest</p>
      <h2 id="newest" class="watch-intro__title">{{ newest.title }}</h2>
      <p class="video-card__meta">{% if newest.short %}Short · {% endif %}{{ newest.published | readableDate }}</p>
      <div class="actions">{{ subscribe() }}</div>
      <p class="video-note">Videos play from YouTube when you press play.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- else %}
<section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="soon">
  <div class="wrap empty">
    <span class="empty__mark flutter">{{ logo() }}</span>
    <h2 id="soon">The first videos are on their way</h2>
    <p>Subscribe on YouTube to see them first{% if youtube.featured %}, and meet Tamica in her introduction on the <a href="/">Home page</a>{% endif %}.</p>
    <div class="actions actions--center">{{ subscribe() }}</div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

{%- if more.length %}
<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="more">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">On YouTube</p>
      <h2 id="more">More videos</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="videos">
      {%- for v in more %}
      <li class="video-card">
        {{ video(v) }}
        <h3 class="video-card__title">{{ v.title }}</h3>
        <p class="video-card__meta">{% if v.short %}Short · {% endif %}{{ v.published | readableDate }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="actions actions--center">
      {{ subscribe() }}
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ youtube.channelUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See all on YouTube</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section section--tight places-band" aria-labelledby="follow">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Follow along</p>
      <h2 id="follow">Wherever you watch</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="follow follow--large">
      {%- for s in site.social %}
      <a class="follow__card" href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="follow__name">{{ s.name }}</span>
        <span class="follow__handle">{{ s.handle }}</span>
        <span class="follow__go">Watch on {{ s.name }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ polaroids(places.watch) }}
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What she films</p>
      <h2>Six threads, one story</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="pillars">
      <li><h3>The story behind the story</h3><p>The real moments that became scenes in SEASONS.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Imani’s Europe</h3><p>The places from the books, filmed where they are.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Style from the pages</h3><p>Outfits from the novels, recreated.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Military spouse, then and now</h3><p>Letters, moves, homecomings and the life in between.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Thriving with Hashimoto’s</h3><p>Routines, energy, and what lives in the purse pharmacy.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Two lives</h3><p>Xavier or Marcus? The conversation readers keep having.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
